[{"answer":"Tom, could I ask you for some advice, please?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes of course, if you think I can help.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/2.mp3"},{"answer":"What's it about?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/3.mp3"},{"answer":"It's my first media studies assignment, and I'm not sure how to go about it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/4.mp3"},{"answer":"You must have done it last year.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Is that the one comparing the coverage of a particular story in a range of newspapers?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/6.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/7-2024-10-31-09-28-01.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh yes, I really enjoyed writing it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/8.mp3"},{"answer":"So what sort of things do I need to compare?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, there are several things.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/10.mp3"},{"answer":"For example, there's the question of which page of the newspaper the item appears on.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/11.mp3"},{"answer":"You mean, because there's a big difference between having it on the front page and the bottom of page ten, for instance?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Exactly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/13.mp3"},{"answer":"And that shows how important the editor thinks the story is.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Then there's the size:","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/15.mp3"},{"answer":"how many column inches the story is given,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/16.mp3"},{"answer":"how many columns it spreads over.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/17.mp3"},{"answer":"And I suppose that includes the headline.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/18.mp3"},{"answer":"It certainly does.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/19.mp3"},{"answer":"It's all part of attracting the reader's attention.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/20.mp3"},{"answer":"What about graphics -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/21.mp3"},{"answer":"whether there's anything visual in addition to the text?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/22-2023-11-18-22-24-58.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, you need to consider those, too,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/23.mp3"},{"answer":"because they can have a big effect on the reader's understanding of the story -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/24.mp3"},{"answer":"sometimes a bigger effect than the text itself.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/25.mp3"},{"answer":"Then you'll need to look at how the item is put together:","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/26.mp3"},{"answer":"what structure is it given?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Bear in mind that not many people read beyond the first paragraph,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/28.mp3"},{"answer":"so what has the journalist put at the beginning?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/29.mp3"},{"answer":"And if, say, there are conflicting opinions about something,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/30.mp3"},{"answer":"does one appear near the end, where people probably won't read it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/31.mp3"},{"answer":"And newspapers sometimes give wrong or misleading information, don't they?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/32.mp3"},{"answer":"Either deliberately or by accident.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Should I be looking at that, too?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/34.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, if you can.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/35.mp3"},{"answer":"Compare what's in different versions, and as far as possible,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/36.mp3"},{"answer":"try and work out what's true and what isn't.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/37.mp3"},{"answer":"And that relates to a very important point:","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/38.mp3"},{"answer":"what's the writer's purpose,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/39.mp3"},{"answer":"or at least the most important one, if they have several.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/40.mp3"},{"answer":"It may seem to be to inform the public,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/41.mp3"},{"answer":"but often it's that they want to create fear, or controversy,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/42.mp3"},{"answer":"or to make somebody look ridiculous.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/43.mp3"},{"answer":"Gosh, I see what you mean.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/44.mp3"},{"answer":"I suppose the writer may make assumptions about the reader.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/45-2024-10-31-09-43-55.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right - about their knowledge of the subject, their attitudes, and their level of education,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/46.mp3"},{"answer":"which means writing so that the readers understand without feeling patronised.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/47.mp3"},{"answer":"All of that will make a difference to how the story is presented.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/48.mp3"},{"answer":"Does it matter what type of story I write about?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/49.mp3"},{"answer":"No, national or international politics, the arts... anything,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/50.mp3"},{"answer":"as long as it's covered in two or three newspapers.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/51.mp3"},{"answer":"Though of course it'll be easier and more fun if it's something you're interested in and know something about.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/52.mp3"},{"answer":"And on that basis a national news item would be worth analysing -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/53.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm quite keen on politics, so I'll try and find a suitable topic.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/54.mp3"},{"answer":"What did you choose for your analysis, Tom?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/55.mp3"},{"answer":"I was interested in how newspapers express their opinions explicitly,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/56.mp3"},{"answer":"so I wanted to compare editorials in different papers,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/57.mp3"},{"answer":"but when I started looking,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/58.mp3"},{"answer":"I couldn't find two on the same topic that I felt like analysing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/59.mp3"},{"answer":"In that case, I won't even bother to look.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/60.mp3"},{"answer":"So in the end I chose a human interest story -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/61.mp3"},{"answer":"a terribly emotional story about a young girl who was very ill,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/62.mp3"},{"answer":"and lots of other people - mostly strangers -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/63.mp3"},{"answer":"raised money so she could go abroad for treatment.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/64.mp3"},{"answer":"Actually, I was surprised -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/65.mp3"},{"answer":"some papers just wrote about how wonderful everyone was,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/66.mp3"},{"answer":"but others considered the broader picture,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/67.mp3"},{"answer":"like why treatment wasn't available here.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/68.mp3"},{"answer":"Hmm, I usually find stories like that raise quite strong feelings in me!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/69.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll avoid that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/70.mp3"},{"answer":"Perhaps I'll choose an arts topic,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/71.mp3"},{"answer":"like different reviews of a film, or something about funding for the arts -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/72.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll think about that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/73.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, that might be interesting.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/74.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, well thanks a lot for your help, Tom. It's been really useful.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/75.mp3"},{"answer":"You're welcome.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/76.mp3"},{"answer":"Good luck with the assignment, Hazel.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-3-part-3-2023-01-18-10-53-46/77.mp3"}]
